### CREATE RESERVATION 1 - STANDARD

POST {{reservationUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": {{room101Id}},
  "rateId": {{barStandardRateId}},
  "paymentCategoryId": 1,
  "primaryGuestId": {{profile1Id}},
  "guestIds": [{{profile1Id}}, {{profile2Id}}],
  "checkIn": "2026-10-30T14:00:00",
